! QED arm: FULL -- lepton line plus quark line, both showers.
!
! Adds photon radiation off the quarks.  This does NOT move the reconstructed
! DIS kinematics, which are built from the scattered lepton alone, so the
! difference between this arm and `fsrisr` (muon) or `fsr` (neutrino) is a
! hadronic-final-state effect: it shows up in the charged multiplicity, the
! leading-hadron energy and the D-meson panels rather than in Q2, x or y.
TimeShower:QEDshowerByL = on
TimeShower:QEDshowerByQ = on
SpaceShower:QEDshowerByL = on
SpaceShower:QEDshowerByQ = on
